  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" rel=\"nofollow\">地形地貌</a></h2><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/393/terralith.png\" alt=\"header\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></h5><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>模组概述</strong></h2><p>本模组使地形地貌(Terralith)兼容动态树木(Dynamic Trees)，在世界生成时为各类生物群系添加动态生长的树木。<br>树木的生长行为及生成规则可通过树木包(Tree Packs)进行自定义调整。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>特色功能</strong></strong></h2><h4><strong>世界生成&nbsp;</strong></h4><p>所有地形地貌生物群系均会生成定制树木，种类繁多难以尽述！以下是部分生物群系的新面貌示例：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/676/screenshot_2023-08-07_195732.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"361\"></p><p>盾构林地</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/678/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"358\"></p><p>樱花山谷</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/680/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"396\"></p><p>紫晶雨林</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/682/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"375\"></p><p>冬霜与秋色空岛</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/688/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"883\" height=\"458\"></p><p>阿尔卑斯高地</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/937/691/image.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"883\" height=\"465\"></p><p>森林高地</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>还有更多精彩内容！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>其他扩展</strong></strong></h2><p>其他模组的动态树木扩展可在<a href=\"https://github.com/DynamicTreesTeam/DynamicTrees/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木维基</a>查阅。</p><h4><strong>建议与请求：</strong></h4><p>如需为其他模组申请兼容性支持，请在此提交！！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>运行要求</strong></strong></h2><p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft动态树木模组<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft地形地貌模组</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>授权与整合包</strong></h2><p>您可以自由地将本模组加入任何整合包！无需申请授权。<br>本模组采用<strong>MIT</strong>开源协议，源代码已在GitHub公开。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
